{"2259580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "XANNIBAN", "steam_appid": 2259580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER XANNI-CORP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken beneath in <strong>XANNIBAN</strong>, a <strong>point-and-click driven action-horror shooter</strong> that blends <strong>strategic planning</strong> with <strong>quick reflexes</strong>. Take control of the Trespasser, a vessel tasked with finding an important figure within the depths of a rogue corporation's underground facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/0ad5073f022e939f7c81181244cb296c.poster.avif?t=1786310769\" width=700 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/0ad5073f022e939f7c81181244cb296c.webm?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/0ad5073f022e939f7c81181244cb296c.mp4?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTAIN ROGUE MACHINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to<strong> lure, counter, and trap </strong>adaptive enemies. Navigate your way through <strong>sprawling facilities filled with traps and hazards</strong> as you <strong>lead threats into their containment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/9f49072f08764de8db369b3282984675.poster.avif?t=1786310769\" width=698 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/9f49072f08764de8db369b3282984675.webm?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/9f49072f08764de8db369b3282984675.mp4?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UTILIZE YOUR TOOLKIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the chambers of XANNI-CORP<strong> </strong>using various tools. <strong>Bring foes to you and deflect attacks with your flare-gun</strong>, <strong>break through passageways and block enemy strikes with a caliper</strong>, and <strong>discover more equipment</strong> deep within the corporation's premises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/8865b19219ae2a19553bbc4709d6b076.poster.avif?t=1786310769\" width=700 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/8865b19219ae2a19553bbc4709d6b076.webm?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/8865b19219ae2a19553bbc4709d6b076.mp4?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE LIMITED RESOURCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep track and maintain resources</strong> for both your tools &amp; the facility's systems. <strong>Gain ammo</strong> through finding spare flares, <strong>use items</strong> discovered in each sector to make progress &amp; keep the facility's power running, and <strong>closely monitor your limited vitals</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/aed35b940ad6fc5febac1f510cdb6a3b.poster.avif?t=1786310769\" width=700 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/aed35b940ad6fc5febac1f510cdb6a3b.webm?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/aed35b940ad6fc5febac1f510cdb6a3b.mp4?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAMPAIGN</strong>: Survive<i> </i>dark facilities filled with hazards, traps, and obstacles. Fight and contain threats as you unearth a sealed away epidemic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE GAMEPLAY</strong>: XANNIBAN blends  point &amp; click controls with dungeon-crawler movement. Dash between rooms and continuously adapt to your environment &amp; nearby enemies. Route your path through dynamic level elements, and plan your moves. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESOURCE MANAGEMENT:</strong> Keep a close eye on  limited flare-gun ammo, tool durability &amp; sector power. Fuel the facility's generators to keep various systems &amp; lights powered on - or struggle in darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABILITIES &amp; PERKS</strong>: Empower your vessel with abilities and perks, constructed in The Hub from scrap you obtain through combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUB</strong>: Return to a safe space after beating a level to upgrade your equipment, equip tools &amp; view player stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCORES &amp; TIMES</strong>: Compete against other trespassers for the best times and scores on level leader-boards, viewable within the pause menu. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong>: Use fast &amp; simple controls on multiple input methods:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard &amp; Mouse (adapts to layout)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Only</p></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER XANNI-CORP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken beneath in <strong>XANNIBAN</strong>, a <strong>point-and-click driven action-horror shooter</strong> that blends <strong>strategic planning</strong> with <strong>quick reflexes</strong>. Take control of the Trespasser, a vessel tasked with finding an important figure within the depths of a rogue corporation's underground facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/0ad5073f022e939f7c81181244cb296c.poster.avif?t=1786310769\" width=700 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/0ad5073f022e939f7c81181244cb296c.webm?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/0ad5073f022e939f7c81181244cb296c.mp4?t=1786310769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTAIN ROGUE MACHINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to<strong> lure, counter, and trap </strong>adaptive enemies. Navigate your way through <strong>sprawling facilities filled with traps and hazards</strong> as you <strong>lead threats into their containment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/9f49072f08764de8db369b3282984675.poster.avif?t=1786310769\" width=698 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/extras/9f49072f08764de8db369b3282984675.