 (adapts to layout)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Only</p></li></ul></li></ul>", "short_description": "Point &amp; click to survive the complexes of XANNI-CORP - plan, lure and adapt in this action-horror shooter as you seal away rogue machines.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/881263a618fc9094f2f6697f65a9ff404abd1b1d/header.jpg?t=1786310769", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/67af0b73f0b0b6b270b7f43d3daec65488bd110f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786310769", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259580/67af0b73f0b0b6b270b7f43d3daec65488bd110f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786310769", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended. Vulkan graphics API support required.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1080 / AMD RX 5700 XT</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for Vulkan 1.2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum":